{"run_id": "planned-4192-s01-8715af", "t": 36.199, "type": "tool_call", "step": 4, "plan_step": 3, "name": "code_read_file", "input": {"path": "src/components/ExportButton.tsx", "response_format": "concise"}, "is_error": false, "latency_s": 0.008, "result_chars": 2372, "result_excerpt": "src/components/ExportButton.tsx (2,321 characters)\nimport { useState } from \"react\";\nimport { SUPPORTED_FORMATS, type ExportFormat } from \"../exportUtils\";\nimport { t } from \"../i18n\";\nimport { useToast } from \"./Toast\";\n\nconst TOKEN_KEY = \"ledgerline.token\";\n\nfunction authHeader(): Record<string, s", "paths": ["src/components/ExportButton.tsx"]}
{"run_id": "planned-4192-s01-8715af", "t": 41.787, "type": "model_call", "step": 5, "purpose": "execute", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "stop_reason": "tool_use", "latency_s": 5.549, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2800, "output_tokens": 438, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "prompt_tokens": 2800}, "cost_usd": 0.00998, "tool_calls": [{"name": "issues_comment", "input": {"issue": "issue-4192", "body": "label: bug\nfile: src/components/ExportButton.tsx\n\nThe `handleClick` handler only calls `setBusy(false)` inside the `.then()` of `exportReport`. When the fetch fails (non-2xx response), the promise rejects and there is no `.catch`/`finally`, so `setBusy` is never reset to `false` and the button (and format select) remain disabled until a full page reload. The fix is to wrap the call with a `.catch`/`finally` (or try/catch with async/await) that resets `busy` to `false` and surfaces an error toast on failure."}}], "tools": ["issues_comment"], "request": 8, "text": ""}
{"run_id": "planned-4192-s01-8715af", "t": 48.135, "type": "model_call", "step": 6, "purpose": "execute", "model": "claude-sonnet-5", "stop_reason": "tool_use", "latency_s": 6.33, "usage": {"input_tokens": 3011, "output_tokens": 565, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "prompt_tokens": 3011}, "cost_usd": 0.011672, "tool_calls": [{"name": "pulls_open", "input": {"issue": "issue-4192", "branch": "repomind/issue-4192", "title": "Re-enable the export button after a failed export", "body": "File: src/components/ExportButton.tsx\n\nIn `handleClick`, `exportReport(reportId, format)` is only followed by a `.then()` that clears the busy state and shows a success toast. When the returned promise rejects (for example because the server responds with a non-2xx status, which `exportReport` turns into a thrown error), there is no `.catch()` handler, so `setBusy(false)` is never called and the button remains disabled until the page is reloaded.\n\nProposed fix: add a `.catch()` (or wrap the call in try/catch with async/await) that calls `setBusy(false)` and shows an error toast on failure, mirroring the success path. This ensures the button becomes clickable again regardless of whether the export succeeds or fails."}}], "tools": ["pulls_open"], "request": 9, "text": ""}
{"run_id": "planned-4192-s01-8715af", "t": 48.154, "type": "checkpoint", "step": 4, "mode": "sync"}
{"run_id": "planned-4192-s01-8715af", "t": 48.168, "type": "tool_call", "step": 6, "plan_step": 4, "name": "pulls_open", "input": {"issue": "issue-4192", "branch": "repomind/issue-4192", "title": "Re-enable the export button after a failed export", "body": "File: src/components/ExportButton.tsx\n\nIn `handleClick`, `exportReport(reportId, format)` is only followed by a `.then()` that clears the busy state and shows a success toast. When the returned promise rejects (for example because the server responds with a non-2xx status, which `exportReport` turns into a thrown error), there is no `.catch()` handler, so `setBusy(false)` is never called and the button remains disabled until the page is reloaded.\n\nProposed fix: add a `.catch()` (or wrap the call in try/catch with async/await) that calls `setBusy(false)` and shows an error toast on failure, mirroring the success path. This ensures the button becomes clickable again regardless of whether the export succeeds or fails."}, "is_error": false, "latency_s": 0.013, "result_chars": 75, "result_excerpt": "{\"pull_request\": \"pr-43\", \"branch\": \"repomind/issue-4192\", \"state\": \"open\"}", "paths": []}
